:::text id=Q2sRjt5uKg at=center width=80% height=200 offsetY=80 preset=body align=left
A single paragraph that explains the headline. Keep it short — three sentences, four at most. The reader should be able to take it in without slowing down. If it doesn't fit in one breath, break it into bullets instead.
